🏢 Corporate Relevance

This mirrors how enterprises structure AWS access:

Engineers log in with low privilege accounts

Privileges are granted via roles

MFA is mandatory

Root account is locked down

Emergency access exists but is controlled

Permissions are attached to groups, not individuals

